1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9F%D1%83%D1%82%D1%8F%D1%82%D0%B0,_%D0%9D%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B9_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87 Википедия]
