1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Marie was my grandfather's sister.  My mother remembers my grandfather talking about his sister "Maya" occasionally. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie met and married an American soldier in Paris. She moved to Detroit, Michigan, USA with her new husband, Andrew Yevich. They had a son, Sergei Michael Yevich.  Andrew and Marie divorced around 1950. Marie moved back to Paris.
2 CONC
2 CONT
2 CONT My grandfather told my mother that Marie died of breast cancer when she was around 25 years old.  Her son grew up with his father and step-mother in the USA.  
