2 CONT Dimitri Galitzine, 1896 - 1985
2 CONT Dimitri Galitzine was born on December 7 1896, in Doljik, to Alexander Galitzine and Catharine Nikolaievna Galitzine (born Khvostchinsky).
2 CONT Dimitri married Helena Flowerdew Galitzine (born Veitch) on August 12 1921, at age 24 in Paris, France.
2 CONT Helena was born on October 10 1882, in Dunbar Scotland.
2 CONT They had one child.
2 CONT They divorced in 1931.
2 CONT Dimitri then married Tatiana Galitzine (born Kaveline) on August 27 1931, at age 34 in Paris, France.
2 CONT Tatiana was born on August 22 1905, in Zoppot, Poland.
2 CONT They divorced in 1943.
2 CONT Dimitri then married Vera Vera /Yarmonkina/ Vera /Jarmonkine/ Valentinovna Raffalovich (born Raffalovich Yarmonkine) on September 6 1945, at age 48 in Paris, France.
2 CONT Vera was born on November 14 1903, in St Petersburg, Russia.
2 CONT Dimitri then married Jacqueline Jeanne Galitzine (born De Ronseray) on February 6 1954, at age 57 in Paris, France.
2 CONT Jacqueline was born on May 21 1909, in Paris, France.
2 CONT Dimitri then married Ms. Galitzine (born Bergon) on January 31 1970, at age 73 in Ville d'Avray.
2 CONT Dimitri passed away on January 27 1985, at age 88 in Ville d'Avray, France.
2 CONT
