1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Simeon Karl Eugen Josef Leopold Erzherzog von Österreich''' was born on 29 June 1958 at Katana, Belgian Congo. He is the son of Rudolf Syringus Erzherzog von Österreich and Kseniya Sergeievna Besobrasova. He mar
